{% extends 'layout/shop.html.twig' %}

{% set title = 'Support' %}

{% block content %}
<section class="content-page">
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Have a question about an order? Start here.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:{{ store.email }}">{{ store.email }}</a>
        and include your order number and the email address used at checkout — that's
        the fastest way for us to look up an order. We aim to reply within 1–2
        business days.
    </p>

    <h2>Where's my order?</h2>
    <p>
        Check the confirmation page you were sent to after payment, or the order
        confirmation email, using your order number and checkout email. If payment
        status still shows <em>unpaid</em> shortly after you paid, give it a few
        minutes for the confirmation to arrive before contacting us. Bank transfers
        are marked paid once the money reaches our account.
    </p>

    <h2>My payment didn't go through</h2>
    <p>
        If the payment page expired or something went wrong before you finished
        paying, no charge was made and no order will show as paid — you can simply
        check out again. If you were charged but your order still shows
        <em>unpaid</em> or <em>failed</em> after 30 minutes, contact us with your
        order number and, if you have it, the payment/track ID from the payment
        page.
    </p>

    <h2>I need to change or cancel an order</h2>
    <p>
        Contact us as soon as possible after checkout. Once an order has shipped we
        can't redirect or cancel it, so the sooner you reach out, the more options
        we have.
    </p>

    <h2>Something arrived wrong or damaged</h2>
    <p>
        Email us with your order number and a description (and photos, if relevant)
        of the issue. We'll sort out a replacement or refund on a case-by-case basis.
    </p>

    <p class="updated-note">Last updated August 2026.</p>
</section>
{% endblock %}
